{
  "name": "Day 59 Solution: Form Builders",
  "description": "Two webhook-triggered form intake flows (Tally flat payload, Typeform nested payload) that validate required fields, send a confirmation email, and log the submission to Airtable.",
  "tags": [
    "week9",
    "real-tools",
    "forms",
    "tally",
    "typeform",
    "webhook"
  ],
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "overview-sticky",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        140,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 59 Solution: Form Builders\n\nTwo independent webhook-triggered flows in this canvas: a Tally-style flat-payload form (top) and a Typeform-style nested-payload form (bottom). Both validate required fields, then send a confirmation email and log the submission to Airtable in parallel.\n\n**Credentials needed to run for real:** Gmail OAuth2, Airtable Personal Access Token.\n\nSee DAILY_TASKS/DAY_59_Form_Builders.md for the full task.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 460
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tally-flow-sticky",
      "name": "Flow 1: Tally",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        140,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Tally flow\nTally delivers a flat payload (fields already at the top level of `$json`). Webhook path: `tally-form-submit`.",
        "height": 140,
        "width": 260
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "typeform-flow-sticky",
      "name": "Flow 2: Typeform",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        140,
        760
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Typeform flow\nTypeform nests answers inside `form_response.answers[]`, addressed by field ID -- not by name. Webhook path: `typeform-submit`.",
        "height": 140,
        "width": 260
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "typeform-fieldid-sticky",
      "name": "Placeholder Field IDs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1400,
        700
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Replace before using\n\n`name_field_id`, `email_field_id`, and `message_field_id` below are placeholders. Open a raw Typeform webhook payload in n8n's execution log and copy the real `field.id` values for your form, then swap them in the Extract Typeform Fields node.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 320
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tally-webhook",
      "name": "Tally Form Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        420,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "path": "tally-form-submit",
        "httpMethod": "POST"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tally-extract",
      "name": "Extract Tally Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        680,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "name",
              "value": "={{ $json.name }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "email",
              "value": "={{ $json.email }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ $json.message }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tally-validate",
      "name": "Validate Required Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        940,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "tally-validate-c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.email }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "tally-validate-c2",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.name }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tally-send-email",
      "name": "Send Confirmation Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "subject": "We received your message",
        "message": "={{ 'Hi ' + $json.name + ',\\n\\nThanks for reaching out -- we received your message and will reply within 1 business day.\\n\\nYour message: ' + $json.message }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tally-log-airtable",
      "name": "Log Submission",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "create",
        "base": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "your_base_id",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "table": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Form Submissions",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Name": "={{ $json.name }}",
            "Email": "={{ $json.email }}",
            "Message": "={{ $json.message }}",
            "Source": "Tally",
            "Submitted At": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tally-validation-failed",
      "name": "Validation Failed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1200,
        620
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "error",
              "value": "Missing required field: name or email"
            },
            {
              "name": "raw_payload",
              "value": "={{ $json }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "typeform-webhook",
      "name": "Typeform Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        420,
        840
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "path": "typeform-submit",
        "httpMethod": "POST"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "typeform-extract",
      "name": "Extract Typeform Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        680,
        840
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "name",
              "value": "={{ $json.form_response.answers.find(a => a.field.id === 'name_field_id')?.text }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "email",
              "value": "={{ $json.form_response.answers.find(a => a.field.id === 'email_field_id')?.email }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ $json.form_response.answers.find(a => a.field.id === 'message_field_id')?.text }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "typeform-validate",
      "name": "Validate Required Fields (Typeform)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        940,
        840
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "typeform-validate-c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.email }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "typeform-validate-c2",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.name }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "typeform-send-email",
      "name": "Send Confirmation Email (Typeform)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        720
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "subject": "We received your submission",
        "message": "={{ 'Hi ' + $json.name + ',\\n\\nThanks for filling out our form -- we received your submission and will follow up shortly.\\n\\nYour message: ' + $json.message }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "typeform-log-airtable",
      "name": "Log Submission (Typeform)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        900
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "create",
        "base": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "your_base_id",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "table": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Form Submissions",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Name": "={{ $json.name }}",
            "Email": "={{ $json.email }}",
            "Message": "={{ $json.message }}",
            "Source": "Typeform",
            "Submitted At": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "typeform-validation-failed",
      "name": "Validation Failed (Typeform)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1200,
        1080
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "error",
              "value": "Missing required field: name or email"
            },
            {
              "name": "raw_payload",
              "value": "={{ $json }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
